entrally fibrotic mass with ill defined borders is present within the middle of the specimen just to the medial side of the nipple  The tumor is 1 0cm deep to the skin and is grossly 0 5cm from the closest deep margin  Sectioning through the remainder of the breast demonstrates focal areas of fibrosis  however no other localized tumor nodules are identified  Sectioning through the axillary tail demonstrates multiple possible lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE in greatest diameter up to 2 3cm in greatest diameter  This largest node is grossly positive  Note  Fresh tissue was submitted for biochemical ER PR studies  SECTION CODE  A  tumor plus deep margin B D  representative sections of tumor E G  nipple HandI  representative section from the medial half of the breast J  superior margin K  inferior margin L  representative section from the lateral portion of the breast M S  all are half of each lymph node identified  Resident  C  Diana Jordan  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Thomas J Lynch  M D  David L Gibbs  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
