esult was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 16 09 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm piece of breast  containing an ill defined tan firm mass  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  grossly abutting the inked resection margin  A touch prep is obtained from the mass  Sections of the mass are submitted in A D  The remaining breast parenchyma is unremarkable and two random sections are submitted in E and F  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
