ified  4 0cm medial to the biopsy cavity  The remaining cut surface displays focal areas of dense white fibrous tissue with no additional masses or lesions identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity  containing surgical clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest posterior margin to biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity to skin defect   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity to surrounding tissue  with surgical clip identified in the biopsy cavity area within  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Dense white fibrous tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Area where additional surgical clip is identified  4 0cm medial to mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional fibrous tissue   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant tissue  which may represent lymph nodes  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  report_end  , Unchecked.
